cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this knowledge base, please cite it as below. Cite the original papers for any finding you use."
type: dataset
title: "Evidence base on product testing with users in agriculture. An AI-ready synthesis of the literature"
abstract: >-
  A knowledge base of the open-access literature on tricot, on-farm testing
  and product testing with farmers and consumers. Each paper is distilled into
  a verified markdown card with its main argument, methods, stated limitations,
  key numbers with their primary sources, and links to the underlying data and
  code. The repository works as a Claude skill and is readable by people and
  other AI tools.
